{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'PG&E SAYS NEARING FULL RESTORATION FOLLOWING SYSTEM-WIDE WIDESPREAD WIND EVENTS', 'text': 'OCT 31  - PG&E CORP <PCG.N>::PG&E NEARING FULL RESTORATION FOLLOWING SYSTEM-WIDE HISTORIC AND WIDESPREAD WIND EVENTS; APPROXIMATELY 6,700 CUSTOMERS REMAIN OUT OF SERVICE.THAT IT HAD RESTORED POWER TO 358,300 CUSTOMERS SINCE OCTOBER 29 "ALL CLEAR" WAS GIVEN WEDNESDAY MORNING.PG&E IS WORKING TO RESTORE POWER IN FOLLOWING COUNTIES: MARIN, NAPA, SIERRA AND SONOMA.WILL SUBMIT A REPORT DETAILING DAMAGES TO CALIFORNIA PUBLIC UTILITIES COMMISSION WITHIN 10 DAYS OF COMPLETION OF PSPS.'}